  "title": {
   "en": "The Regressed Mercenary Has a Plan"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "회귀한 용병은 다 계획이 있다"
   },
   {
    "ko-ro": "Hoegwihan Yongbyeongeun Da Gyehoegi Itda"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Regressed Mercenary's Machinations"
   },
   {
    "en": "Every Returned Mercenary Has a Plan"
   },
   {
    "fr": "L'intrigue surprenante d'un mercenaire régresseur"
   },
   {
    "es": "Las conspiraciones del mercenario regresado"
   },
   {
    "zh": "重生佣兵王的复仇"
